    voiceinput: use imported models for non-current languages; auto-detect language on QNN

    Voice input ignored per-language imports unless that language was the current
    subtype: languageSpecificModels was always empty after the per-language import
    rewrite, so whisper.cpp fell back to the primary model (usually tiny.en) for
    everything. Populate it from the other active locales and prefer any explicitly
    imported model over the tiny built-in English fallback when choosing the
    primary.

